sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor You
  participant VS as VS Code
  participant AI as AI agent
  participant Git as Git (on your PC)
  participant GH as GitHub
  You->>VS: Open the repo folder
  You->>Git: Create a branch (git checkout -b feature/x)
  You->>AI: "Build the page described in specs/x.md"
  AI->>VS: Edits files in Template.Report / Template.SemanticModel
  AI->>You: Runs checks, shows screenshots, reports
  You->>VS: Review changes in the Source Control view
  You->>Git: Stage + commit with a clear message
  Git->>GH: git push (upload your branch)
  You->>GH: Open a pull request
  GH->>You: CODEOWNERS reviewers are asked to review
  GH->>GH: Reviewer approves, branch is merged
